Nexmark queries and event generator
===================================

This directory vendors files from the Nexmark benchmark suite for Apache Flink:

  Repository: https://github.com/nexmark/nexmark
  Commit:     6b3646c3baec701f1fa74baf938d235f742e5d3c (master, 2025-12-26)
  Licence:    Apache License, Version 2.0 (vendor/LICENSE, copied from the
              repository root at that commit)

Vendored verbatim (byte for byte), under vendor/queries/:

  nexmark-flink/src/main/resources/queries/ddl_gen.sql
  nexmark-flink/src/main/resources/queries/ddl_views.sql
  nexmark-flink/src/main/resources/queries/q0.sql ... q22.sql

The upstream SQL files carry no per-file licence header; they are covered by
the repository's Apache-2.0 LICENSE.

Derived from those files (modified, see README.md for every change):

  q0/ ... q22/  setup.sql and query.sql, Loams Stream conformance cases

Ported to Rust (modified; see the header of the Rust file):

  nexmark-flink/src/main/java/com/github/nexmark/flink/generator/
    GeneratorConfig.java, NexmarkGenerator.java, SideInputGenerator.java,
    model/PersonGenerator.java, model/AuctionGenerator.java,
    model/BidGenerator.java, model/PriceGenerator.java,
    model/StringsGenerator.java, model/LongGenerator.java
  nexmark-flink/src/main/java/com/github/nexmark/flink/NexmarkConfiguration.java
    (defaults)
  ->  native/loams-stream-conformance/src/nexmark.rs

data/ was generated by that port (README.md has the command).

The Nexmark generator itself derives from Apache Beam's Nexmark suite
(https://github.com/apache/beam, sdks/java/testing/nexmark, Apache-2.0),
whose per-event java.util.Random seeding the port follows.
